          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "part": 3,
      "label": "Part 3",
      "instruction": "Talk together with your partner about the situation.",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q3",
          "number": 3,
          "points": 20,
          "skills": [],
          "material": [
            {
              "id": "i2",
              "type": "imageRef",
              "image": "img2"
            }
          ],
          "interaction": {
            "kind": "speaking",
            "prompt": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Talk with your partner about the different prizes a sports club could give the winning team of a volleyball competition, and decide which the winning team would like best."
              }
            ],
            "turns": [
              {
                "id": "t1",
                "text": "Now, in this part of the test you’re going to talk about something together for about two minutes. I’m going to describe a situation to you. A sports club is going to have a volleyball competition. The sports club wants to give the winning team a prize. Here are some different prizes the sports club could give. Talk together about the different prizes and say which the winning team would like best. All right? Now, talk together.",
                "role": "examiner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t4-s-q3-t1.mp3",
                  "seconds": 31
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t2",
                "text": "Shall I start? I think a cup is a great prize, because the team can keep it at the club for years. What do you think?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t4-s-q3-t2.mp3",
                  "seconds": 7.4
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t3",
                "text": "That’s true. What about the T-shirts? Everyone in the team gets one, and they can wear them when they play. Do you agree?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t4-s-q3-t3.mp3",
                  "seconds": 8.2
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t4",
                "text": "I’m not sure about the money. It isn’t very special, and it’s hard to share. What’s your opinion?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t4-s-q3-t4.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.6
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t5",
                "text": "Chocolates or flowers are nice, but they don’t last very long. Which one do you prefer?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t4-s-q3-t5.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.5
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t6",
                "text": "The water bottles are useful for training, but the toy monkey is fun too. What do you think about them?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t4-s-q3-t6.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t7",
                "text": "So, which prize do you think the team would like best? I think the T-shirts, because everyone can have one.",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t4-s-q3-t7.mp3",
                  "seconds": 7
                }
              }
            ],
            "maxSeconds": 45,
            "scoring": "judge"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
